&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;About the Columbia Initaitive Seminar Series&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
The Columbia Initiative in Cell Engineering and Therapy (CICET) presents its 2026 Winter&amp;ndash;Spring Seminar Series, featuring leading investigators in human cell engineering and cellular immunotherapy. The series highlights advances across basic, translational, and clinical research in the field.&lt;/p&gt;

